  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-navy pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energetic Radiation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Captain_Atom_2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190220110824\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Captain Atom 2\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Captain_Atom_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190220110824\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Captain_Atom_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190220110824 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Captain_Atom_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20190220110824 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Captain Atom 2\" width=\"270\" height=\"410\" data-image-key=\"Captain_Atom_2.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Captain Atom 2.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nathaniel Adams/Captain Atom (DC Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb energy and convert to radiation.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb energy and convert it towards radiological energies</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Energetic Furnace</li>\n<li>Radiation Capacitance</li>\n<li>Reverse Radioactivity</li>\n<li>Transduction Nucliosis</li>\n<li>Transduction Reactor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb energy and convert it towards radiation. They are capable of creating waves, particles from themselves and around them without issue. They are also capable of manipulating personal radiological forces. Unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Radiation\">Personal Radiation</a>, this power relies on external forces for their radiokinetic abilities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Radiation Manipulation\">Bio-Radiation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Acoustics_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Acoustics Manipulation\">Bio-Acoustics Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Manipulation\">Bio-Cosmic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Gravimetric_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Gravimetric Manipulation\">Bio-Gravimetric Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Manipulation\">Bio-Nuclear Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Energy Metabolization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Heat Manipulation\">Bio-Heat Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Thermic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Thermic Manipulation\">Bio-Thermic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Manipulation\">Bio-Ionic Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Manipulation\">Bio-Plasma Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Radiochemistry_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Radiochemistry Manipulation\">Bio-Radiochemistry Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Spectrum_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Spectrum Manipulation\">Bio-Spectrum Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Manipulation\">Bio-Electromagnetic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatility_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Volatility Manipulation\">Bio-Volatility Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electro-Weak_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Electro-Weak Force Manipulation\">Electro-Weak Force Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Reactive_Perpetuator\" title=\"Bio-Reactive Perpetuator\">Bio-Reactive Perpetuator</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Transformer\">Bio-Cosmic Transformer</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Gravimetric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Gravimetric Dynamo\">Bio-Gravimetric Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Reactor\" title=\"Energetic Reactor\">Energetic Reactor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo\">Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Dynamo\">Bio-Ionic Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Ionization\" title=\"Energetic Ionization\">Energetic Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Sonic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Sonic Dynamo\">Bio-Sonic Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Volatile_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Volatile Dynamo\">Bio-Volatile Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Combustion\" title=\"Energetic Combustion\">Energetic Combustion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Heating\" title=\"Energetic Heating\">Energetic Heating</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energized_Body\" title=\"Energized Body\">Energized Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Detection\" title=\"Energy Detection\">Energy Detection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy\">Personal Energy</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Radiation\">Personal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Cosmic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Cosmic Energy\">Personal Cosmic Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Quantum_Energy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Quantum Energy\">Personal Quantum Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Sound\" title=\"Personal Sound\">Personal Sound</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Concentration\" title=\"Radiation Concentration\">Radiation Concentration</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Radiation Physiology\">Radiation Physiology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Mimicry\" title=\"Ionic Mimicry\">Ionic Mimicry</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capacitance_Manipulation\" title=\"Capacitance Manipulation\">Capacitance Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Manipulation\" title=\"Elemental Manipulation\">Elemental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Sourcing\" title=\"Energy Sourcing\">Energy Sourcing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Conversion\" title=\"Life-Force Conversion\">Life-Force Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Radiation Manipulation\">Radiation Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Power may be limited to how much energy user has/can absorb.</li>\n<li>Opposing <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> powers can weaken user.</li>\n<li>The user may be at a disadvantage in areas with a lack of energy to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Prypiatosian-B\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Prypiatosian-B\">Prypiatosian-Bs</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Captain_Atom\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Captain Atom\">Nathaniel Adams/Captain Atom</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Firestorm\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Firestorm\">Firestorm</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)\n<ul><li>Ronny Raymond</li>\n<li>Jason Rusch</li>\n<li>Martin Stein</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Major_Force\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Major Force\">Clifford Zmeck/Major Force</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fma.fandom.com/wiki/Father\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fma:Father\">Father</a> (<i>Fullmetal Alchemist</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Galan_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Galan (Earth-616)\">Galan/Galactus</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Thaddeus_Ross_(Earth-616)%23Powers_and_Abilities\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Thaddeus Ross (Earth-616)\">Red Hulk</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergetic_Radiation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"02292bc3e7344d2d2f8a9b1b24244abf\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left w